Tue Nov 3 17:50:08 UTC 2026 - afonsusousa <afonso.rocha@outlook.com>

- Update to 0.2.1.
- Build the frontend on OBS too, from an offline npm cache of
  package-lock.json; the source tarball no longer has a prebuilt dist/.
- Drop Ubuntu 24.04: its Node.js is too old for the frontend build.
- Fix overlapping connect attempts, a service failure during sign-in
  re-enabling Connect, and a rejected connection showing "cancelled".
- Keep an unreadable profiles.json (set it aside) instead of
  overwriting it with an empty list.
- "Delete credentials" now lasts until a fresh sign-in succeeds.
- Tone the AI disclaimer down to a small "largely vibe coded" note
  in the window's menu.

